<title>UK: CRICKET-RAIN PREVENTS PLAY IN AUSTRALIA V SOMERSET MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN PREVENTS PLAY IN AUSTRALIA V SOMERSET MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>TAUNTON, England 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain prevented play on the third day of a four-day match between Somerset and the touring Australians on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Somerset 284 and 147-3 (R.Turner 65 not out), Australia 323 (B.Julian 71, S.Waugh 62; A.Caddick 5-54).</p>
